PM condoles the passing away of noted violinist Shri TN Krishnan
The Prime Minister, Shri Narendra Modi has expressed grief over the passing away of noted violinist Shri TN Krishnan.
The Prime Minister said, the demise of noted violinist Shri TN Krishnan leaves a big void in the world of music.
His works beautifully encapsulated a wide range of emotions and strands of our culture.
He was also an outstanding mentor to young musicians.
Condolences to his family and admirers.
Om Shanti.
