The first section of the project presents the basic information of the related subject matter in Ramayana depicted in dance, drama, song, architecture, film, folk, tribal and oral tradition.
The second section contains bibliographic details on the Ramayana in six foreign languages.
A penetrating scholar of Sanskrit literature, Prof. K. Krishnamurti has edited both the volumes, which are considered to be the official scholars of Sanskrit and Ramayana.
